---
// WhyChooseUs.astro — Benefits of partnering with Gemilang Agency
---

<section id="why-choose-us" class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-b-2 border-[var(--color-fg)] bg-[var(--color-bg)]">
  <!-- Section Header -->
  <div class="mb-12 border-b-2 border-[var(--color-fg)] pb-4">
    <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-600 font-bold mb-2">
      <span class="lang-en">Benefits // Why Choose Gemilang Agency</span>
      <span class="lang-id">Manfaat // Mengapa Memilih Gemilang Agency</span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-[var(--color-fg)] tracking-tight">
      <span class="lang-en">WHY PARTNER WITH US</span>
      <span class="lang-id">MENGAPA BERMITRA DENGAN KAMI</span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <!-- Column Grid: 4-cols with Borders -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 border border-[var(--color-fg)] bg-[var(--color-bg-card)]">
    <!-- Pillar 1 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-r border-[var(--color-fg)] hover:bg-[var(--color-bg)] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent)] leading-none mb-4">01</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">Custom-Crafted Code <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">(No Page Builders)</span></span>
          <span class="lang-id">Kode Buatan Kustom <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">(Tanpa Page Builder)</span></span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-en">We don’t use generic WordPress templates or bloated page builders like Elementor. Every line of code is hand-crafted using modern frameworks like Astro, React, and Tailwind CSS. This guarantees your site is unique, secure, and easily scalable.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Kami tidak menggunakan template WordPress umum atau pembuat halaman yang membengkak seperti Elementor. Setiap baris kode dibuat secara manual menggunakan framework modern seperti Astro, React, dan Tailwind CSS. Ini menjamin situs Anda unik, aman, dan mudah diskalakan.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 2 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b lg:border-r border-[var(--color-fg)] md:border-r-0 lg:border-b-0 hover:bg-[var(--color-bg)] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent)] leading-none mb-4">02</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">Sub-Second Speed <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">& Built-In SEO</span></span>
          <span class="lang-id">Kecepatan Tinggi <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">& SEO Terintegrasi</span></span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-en">A slow website is a lost customer. Our sites are engineered to load in under 0.6 seconds and score a perfect 100/100 on Google Lighthouse benchmarks. We build with a mobile-first approach and bake technical SEO into the core architecture from day one.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Situs web yang lambat adalah hilangnya pelanggan. Situs kami dirancang untuk memuat dalam waktu kurang dari 0,6 detik dan mendapat skor sempurna 100/100 pada benchmark Google Lighthouse. Kami membangun dengan pendekatan mobile-first dan menanamkan SEO teknis ke dalam arsitektur inti sejak hari pertama.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 3 -->
    <div class="p-8 border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[var(--color-fg)] hover:bg-[var(--color-bg)] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent)] leading-none mb-4">03</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">Direct Access <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">to Senior Talent</span></span>
          <span class="lang-id">Akses Langsung <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">ke Pengembang Senior</span></span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-en">Skip the middleman. You won’t be passed off to account managers or junior interns. You will collaborate directly with the senior developers building your product, resulting in faster feedback loops and zero miscommunication.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Lewati perantara. Anda tidak akan dioper ke manajer akun atau magang junior. Anda akan berkolaborasi langsung dengan pengembang senior yang membangun produk Anda, menghasilkan komunikasi yang lebih cepat dan bebas salah paham.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Pillar 4 -->
    <div class="p-8 hover:bg-[var(--color-bg)] transition-colors duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="font-serif text-5xl font-black text-[var(--color-accent)] leading-none mb-4">04</div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold uppercase text-[var(--color-fg)] mb-4 leading-tight">
          <span class="lang-en">Transparent <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">Fixed-Price Quotes</span></span>
          <span class="lang-id">Harga Transparan <br/><span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 font-normal tracking-wider">Tanpa Biaya Tambahan</span></span>
        </h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-600 text-justify leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-en">No hidden fees, no hourly rate surprises. We analyze your requirements upfront and provide a fixed-price quote with clear deliverables. Once we launch, you own 100% of the source code—no vendor lock-in, ever.</span>
          <span class="lang-id">Tanpa biaya tersembunyi, tanpa kejutan tarif per jam. Kami menganalisis kebutuhan Anda sejak awal dan memberikan harga tetap dengan deliverables yang jelas. Setelah diluncurkan, Anda memiliki 100% kode sumber—tanpa biaya bulanan paksaan.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
